{"seq":3,"slug":"adr-lifecycle-and-toolchain","title":"ADR 生命周期与工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/adr-fundamentals/adr-lifecycle-and-toolchain","wordCount":1377,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"adr-生命周期与工具链\">ADR 生命周期与工具链</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>架构决策记录不是一次性文档——它有完整的生命周期，从最初的提议到最终被新决策取代，每个阶段都有其特定的规则和管理需求。有效管理 ADR 生命周期是确保决策日志长期健康的关键。同时，随着 ADR 实践的普及，一系列专用工具链的出现让创建、管理和发布 ADR 变得更加高效。本文将系统讲解 ADR 的完整状态流转机制，并深入介绍当前主流的 ADR 工具链及其最佳使用方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"adr-状态模型\">ADR 状态模型</h3><p>一份 ADR 在其生命周期中会经历以下状态：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Proposed: Author creates draft&#10;    Proposed --&gt; Accepted: Team approves&#10;    Proposed --&gt; Rejected: Team rejects&#10;    Accepted --&gt; Deprecated: No longer relevant&#10;    Accepted --&gt; Superseded: Replaced by new ADR&#10;    Rejected --&gt; [*]&#10;    Deprecated --&gt; [*]&#10;    Superseded --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Proposed: Author creates draft\n    Proposed --&gt; Accepted: Team approves\n    Proposed --&gt; Rejected: Team rejects\n    Accepted --&gt; Deprecated: No longer relevant\n    Accepted --&gt; Superseded: Replaced by new ADR\n    Rejected --&gt; [*]\n    Deprecated --&gt; [*]\n    Superseded --&gt; [*]</pre><p><strong>Proposed（提议中）</strong>：ADR 刚被创建，正在讨论中。此时文档内容可以自由修改、补充信息、调整方案。团队成员可以在这个阶段提供反馈、提出疑问、建议替代方案。</p>\n<p><strong>Accepted（已接受）</strong>：团队达成共识并接受了这个决策。从这一刻起，ADR 进入「不可变」状态——其内容不应被修改。这不是技术上的强制限制，而是一种团队约定，目的是保持决策记录的历史真实性。</p>\n<p><strong>Rejected（已拒绝）</strong>：经过讨论后，团队决定不采纳这个提议。被拒绝的 ADR 同样有保留价值——它记录了「我们考虑过但决定不做的事」，防止未来重复提出相同方案。</p>\n<p><strong>Deprecated（已废弃）</strong>：决策曾经有效，但由于外部条件变化（如技术栈升级、业务需求变更）而不再适用。与 Superseded 不同，Deprecated 通常没有直接的替代决策。</p>\n<p><strong>Superseded（已取代）</strong>：最重要的状态转换。当需要修改一个已接受的决策时，不是编辑原始 ADR，而是创建新的 ADR 并将原始 ADR 标记为 Superseded，同时添加到新 ADR 的链接。</p>\n<h3 id=\"不可变性原则的深层含义\">不可变性原则的深层含义</h3><p>不可变性是 ADR 实践区别于普通文档的核心特征。其背后的设计哲学是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>历史真实性</strong>：ADR 记录的是「在那个时刻，基于那些信息，团队做出了什么决策」。事后修改会扭曲这一历史记录。</li>\n<li><strong>决策链可追溯</strong>：通过 Superseded 链接形成的决策链，可以完整还原一个架构选择的演进过程。</li>\n<li><strong>Git 友好</strong>：不可变文件与 git 的追加式历史模型天然契合，diff 清晰、blame 可靠。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"决策链与架构演进\">决策链与架构演进</h3><p>当多个 ADR 形成关联关系时，便构成了「决策链」：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;ADR-001: Use MongoDB&lt;br/&gt;Status: Superseded&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;ADR-007: Migrate to PostgreSQL&lt;br/&gt;Status: Superseded&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;ADR-015: Adopt CockroachDB&lt;br/&gt;Status: Accepted&quot;]&#10;    A -.-&gt; D[&quot;ADR-003: Use Redis for Caching&lt;br/&gt;Status: Accepted&quot;]&#10;    B -.-&gt; E[&quot;ADR-008: Add Read Replicas&lt;br/&gt;Status: Deprecated&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"ADR-001: Use MongoDB&lt;br/&gt;Status: Superseded\"] --&gt; B[\"ADR-007: Migrate to PostgreSQL&lt;br/&gt;Status: Superseded\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"ADR-015: Adopt CockroachDB&lt;br/&gt;Status: Accepted\"]\n    A -.-&gt; D[\"ADR-003: Use Redis for Caching&lt;br/&gt;Status: Accepted\"]\n    B -.-&gt; E[\"ADR-008: Add Read Replicas&lt;br/&gt;Status: Deprecated\"]</pre><p>这种链式结构让任何人都能追溯「为什么数据库从 MongoDB 变成了 CockroachDB」——不是因为某个人的偏好，而是因为业务规模增长带来的一系列具体约束变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"状态转换工作流\">状态转换工作流</h3><p>在实际工作中，以下是管理 ADR 状态转换的推荐流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 创建新 ADR&#10;&#10;1. 从模板创建新文件，编号递增&#10;2. 设置 Status: Proposed&#10;3. 填写 Context 和初步 Decision&#10;4. 提交 PR / 在团队频道分享&#10;5. 收集反馈，更新内容&#10;&#10;## 接受决策&#10;&#10;1. 确认所有必要的评审人已提供反馈&#10;2. 在团队会议中（或异步确认）达成共识&#10;3. 更新 Status: Accepted&#10;4. 记录决策日期和参与决策的人员&#10;5. 合并 PR&#10;&#10;## 取代旧决策&#10;&#10;1. 创建新 ADR，引用旧 ADR 编号&#10;2. 在新 ADR 的 Context 中解释为什么旧决策不再适用&#10;3. 更新旧 ADR 的状态为 Superseded by ADR-[新编号]&#10;4. 两个变更应在同一个 PR 中提交\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 创建新 ADR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">1.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 从模板创建新文件，编号递增</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">2.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 设置 Status: Proposed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">3.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 填写 Context 和初步 Decision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">4.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 提交 PR / 在团队频道分享</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">5.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 收集反馈，更新内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 接受决策</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">1.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 确认所有必要的评审人已提供反馈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">2.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 在团队会议中（或异步确认）达成共识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">3.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 更新 Status: Accepted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">4.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 记录决策日期和参与决策的人员</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">5.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 合并 PR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 取代旧决策</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">1.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 创建新 ADR，引用旧 ADR 编号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">2.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 在新 ADR 的 Context 中解释为什么旧决策不再适用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">3.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 更新旧 ADR 的状态为 Superseded by ADR-[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">新编号</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">4.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 两个变更应在同一个 PR 中提交</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"定期审查机制\">定期审查机制</h3><p>ADR 不是写完就忘的。推荐建立定期审查机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# ADR 审查日历配置示例&#10;adr_review:&#10;  frequency: quarterly&#10;  scope: all-accepted-adrs&#10;  checklist:&#10;    - 决策的前提条件是否仍然成立？&#10;    - 是否有新的技术选项使当前决策不再最优？&#10;    - 决策产生的负面后果是否超出预期？&#10;    - 是否有团队成员对当前决策有未表达的疑虑？&#10;  actions:&#10;    - reaffirm: 确认决策仍然有效，添加审查日期注释&#10;    - supersede: 创建新 ADR 取代当前决策&#10;    - deprecate: 标记为不再适用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ADR 审查日历配置示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">adr_review</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  frequency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">quarterly</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  scope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">all-accepted-adrs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  checklist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">决策的前提条件是否仍然成立？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">是否有新的技术选项使当前决策不再最优？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">决策产生的负面后果是否超出预期？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">是否有团队成员对当前决策有未表达的疑虑？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">reaffirm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">确认决策仍然有效，添加审查日期注释</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">supersede</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">创建新 ADR 取代当前决策</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">deprecate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">标记为不再适用</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"与-git-工作流的集成\">与 Git 工作流的集成</h3><p>ADR 应当与代码变更关联。以下是推荐的 Git 集成实践：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 提交 ADR 时的 commit message 格式&#10;git commit -m &quot;docs(adr): add ADR-042 use event sourcing for order service&#10;&#10;Relates to: JIRA-1234&#10;Reviewers: @alice, @bob, @charlie&quot;&#10;&#10;# 在功能分支中同时包含 ADR 和实现代码&#10;git log --oneline&#10;# a1b2c3d feat(order): implement event sourcing pattern&#10;# d4e5f6g docs(adr): add ADR-042 use event sourcing for order service&#10;# 7h8i9j0 refactor(order): prepare for event sourcing migration\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 提交 ADR 时的 commit message 格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"docs(adr): add ADR-042 use event sourcing for order service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Relates to: JIRA-1234</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Reviewers: @alice, @bob, @charlie\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在功能分支中同时包含 ADR 和实现代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --oneline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># a1b2c3d feat(order): implement event sourcing pattern</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># d4e5f6g docs(adr): add ADR-042 use event sourcing for order service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 7h8i9j0 refactor(order): prepare for event sourcing migration</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"adr-编号策略\">ADR 编号策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局递增</td>\n<td><code>0001</code>, <code>0002</code></td>\n<td>单仓库小团队</td>\n<td>简单明确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期前缀</td>\n<td><code>20260508-001</code></td>\n<td>需要时间排序</td>\n<td>无需中央编号管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领域前缀</td>\n<td><code>auth-001</code>, <code>data-001</code></td>\n<td>多领域大型系统</td>\n<td>分类清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队前缀</td>\n<td><code>platform-001</code></td>\n<td>多团队环境</td>\n<td>归属清晰</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐策略：对于大多数团队，<strong>全局单调递增</strong> 是最佳选择。它简单、无歧义、在目录列表中自然排序。文件名应包含决策标题的 slug 形式（如 <code>0001-use-postgresql-for-primary-database.md</code>），这样即使不打开文件也能快速识别决策内容。</p>\n<h3 id=\"adr-存储位置的选择\">ADR 存储位置的选择</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q[&quot;ADR 的作用范围是什么?&quot;] --&gt; A[&quot;单个服务/项目&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; B[&quot;跨多个服务&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; C[&quot;整个组织&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; A1[&quot;存放在该服务的代码仓库&lt;br/&gt;doc/adr/ 目录&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;存放在专用的架构仓库&lt;br/&gt;architecture-decisions repo&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;存放在组织知识库&lt;br/&gt;Confluence/Wiki + Git 镜像&quot;]\">graph TD\n    Q[\"ADR 的作用范围是什么?\"] --&gt; A[\"单个服务/项目\"]\n    Q --&gt; B[\"跨多个服务\"]\n    Q --&gt; C[\"整个组织\"]\n    A --&gt; A1[\"存放在该服务的代码仓库&lt;br/&gt;doc/adr/ 目录\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"存放在专用的架构仓库&lt;br/&gt;architecture-decisions repo\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"存放在组织知识库&lt;br/&gt;Confluence/Wiki + Git 镜像\"]</pre><h3 id=\"垃圾收集策略\">垃圾收集策略</h3><p>随着时间推移，ADR 日志会不断增长。如何处理历史 ADR：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>永不删除</strong>：所有 ADR（包括 Rejected 和 Superseded）都保留，它们记录了组织的学习过程</li>\n<li><strong>分层归档</strong>：活跃 ADR 保持在主目录，超过 2 年的非活跃 ADR 移到 <code>archive/</code> 子目录</li>\n<li><strong>索引维护</strong>：维护一份 <code>INDEX.md</code> 按主题和状态分类列出所有 ADR</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"adr-工具链全景\">ADR 工具链全景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>核心特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>adr-tools</td>\n<td>CLI</td>\n<td>Bash</td>\n<td>创建/列出/链接 ADR，生成图表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Log4brains</td>\n<td>Web + CLI</td>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>本地预览、GitHub Pages 发布、搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADR Manager</td>\n<td>VS Code 插件</td>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>编辑器内创建、模板选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Structurizr</td>\n<td>架构平台</td>\n<td>Java/DSL</td>\n<td>ADR + C4 模型一体化管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pyadr</td>\n<td>CLI</td>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>Python 生态的 ADR 管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>adr-log</td>\n<td>CLI</td>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>自动生成 ADR 目录和时间线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"log4brains-深度实践\">Log4brains 深度实践</h3><p>Log4brains 是目前最完善的 ADR 发布工具，它将 ADR 转化为可搜索的静态网站：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装&#10;npm install -g log4brains&#10;&#10;# 初始化项目&#10;log4brains init&#10;&#10;# 创建新 ADR&#10;log4brains adr new &quot;Use Redis for session management&quot;&#10;&#10;# 本地预览 ADR 文档站&#10;log4brains preview&#10;&#10;# 构建静态站点用于部署&#10;log4brains build\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log4brains</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 初始化项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log4brains</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建新 ADR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log4brains</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> adr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Use Redis for session management\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 本地预览 ADR 文档站</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log4brains</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> preview</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建静态站点用于部署</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log4brains</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Log4brains 的配置文件 <code>.log4brains.yml</code> 支持多仓库 ADR 聚合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"project:&#10;  name: &#39;My Platform&#39;&#10;  tz: &#39;Asia/Shanghai&#39;&#10;  adrFolder: &#39;docs/adr&#39;&#10;&#10;packages:&#10;  - name: &#39;api-gateway&#39;&#10;    path: &#39;../api-gateway&#39;&#10;    adrFolder: &#39;doc/adr&#39;&#10;  - name: &#39;user-service&#39;&#10;    path: &#39;../user-service&#39;&#10;    adrFolder: &#39;doc/adr&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">project</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'My Platform'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Asia/Shanghai'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  adrFolder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'docs/adr'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'api-gateway'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'../api-gateway'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    adrFolder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'doc/adr'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user-service'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'../user-service'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    adrFolder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'doc/adr'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ci-cd-集成自动化\">CI/CD 集成自动化</h3><p>将 ADR 管理集成到持续交付流程中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/adr-quality.yml&#10;name: ADR Quality Check&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    paths: [&#39;doc/adr/**&#39;]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  validate:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Check ADR format&#10;        run: |&#10;          for f in doc/adr/0*.md; do&#10;            # 检查必须包含 Status 字段&#10;            grep -q &quot;^## Status&quot; &quot;$f&quot; || echo &quot;ERROR: $f missing Status&quot;&#10;            # 检查必须包含 Context 字段&#10;            grep -q &quot;^## Context&quot; &quot;$f&quot; || echo &quot;ERROR: $f missing Context&quot;&#10;            # 检查必须包含 Decision 字段&#10;            grep -q &quot;^## Decision&quot; &quot;$f&quot; || echo &quot;ERROR: $f missing Decision&quot;&#10;          done&#10;&#10;      - name: Check superseded links&#10;        run: |&#10;          # 验证所有 Superseded 引用指向存在的 ADR&#10;          grep -rh &quot;Superseded by ADR-&quot; doc/adr/ | \\&#10;            grep -oP &#39;ADR-\\d+&#39; | while read ref; do&#10;              num=$(echo &quot;$ref&quot; | grep -oP &#39;\\d+&#39;)&#10;              if ! ls doc/adr/$(printf &quot;%04d&quot; $num)*.md 2&gt;/dev/null; then&#10;                echo &quot;ERROR: Reference to non-existent $ref&quot;&#10;              fi&#10;            done\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/adr-quality.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ADR Quality Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'doc/adr/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  validate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Check ADR format</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          for f in doc/adr/0*.md; do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            # 检查必须包含 Status 字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            grep -q \"^## Status\" \"$f\" || echo \"ERROR: $f missing Status\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            # 检查必须包含 Context 字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            grep -q \"^## Context\" \"$f\" || echo \"ERROR: $f missing Context\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            # 检查必须包含 Decision 字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            grep -q \"^## Decision\" \"$f\" || echo \"ERROR: $f missing Decision\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Check superseded links</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          # 验证所有 Superseded 引用指向存在的 ADR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          grep -rh \"Superseded by ADR-\" doc/adr/ | \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            grep -oP 'ADR-\\d+' | while read ref; do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              num=$(echo \"$ref\" | grep -oP '\\d+')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              if ! ls doc/adr/$(printf \"%04d\" $num)*.md 2>/dev/null; then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                echo \"ERROR: Reference to non-existent $ref\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            done</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>ADR 生命周期管理的核心是<strong>不可变性</strong>和<strong>可追溯性</strong>。每份 ADR 一旦被接受就成为历史记录的一部分，只能通过创建新 ADR 来「覆盖」而非「修改」。工具链的选择应遵循渐进原则：从最简单的目录结构和手动管理开始，当团队积累了足够多的 ADR 后再引入 Log4brains 等发布工具。记住，工具是为流程服务的——先建立正确的流程习惯，再用工具来降低摩擦。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ADR 生命周期与工具链","id":"adr-生命周期与工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"ADR 状态模型","id":"adr-状态模型"},{"level":3,"text":"不可变性原则的深层含义","id":"不可变性原则的深层含义"},{"level":3,"text":"决策链与架构演进","id":"决策链与架构演进"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"状态转换工作流","id":"状态转换工作流"},{"level":3,"text":"定期审查机制","id":"定期审查机制"},{"level":3,"text":"与 Git 工作流的集成","id":"与-git-工作流的集成"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"ADR 编号策略","id":"adr-编号策略"},{"level":3,"text":"ADR 存储位置的选择","id":"adr-存储位置的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"垃圾收集策略","id":"垃圾收集策略"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"ADR 工具链全景","id":"adr-工具链全景"},{"level":3,"text":"Log4brains 深度实践","id":"log4brains-深度实践"},{"level":3,"text":"CI/CD 集成自动化","id":"ci-cd-集成自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"ADR 模板设计与最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/adr-fundamentals/adr-template-design"},"next":{"title":"C4 模型深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/architecture-visualization/c4-model-deep-dive"}}